/gate/source/Src3/setActivity       90000 Bq
/gate/source/Src3/gps/pos/type      Volume
/gate/source/Src3/gps/pos/shape     Cylinder
/gate/source/Src3/gps/pos/radius      7.5 mm
/gate/source/Src3/gps/pos/halfz       5.0 mm 
/gate/source/Src3/gps/pos/centre    0.0  +60.0  0.0 mm
/gate/source/Src3/gps/ang/type      iso
/gate/source/Src3/gps/ang/mintheta    0.0 deg
/gate/source/Src3/gps/ang/maxtheta  180.0 deg
