/gate/source/Src4/setActivity      160000 Bq
/gate/source/Src4/gps/pos/type      Volume
/gate/source/Src4/gps/pos/shape     Cylinder
/gate/source/Src4/gps/pos/radius     10.0 mm
/gate/source/Src4/gps/pos/halfz       5.0 mm 
/gate/source/Src4/gps/pos/centre  -42.4  +42.4  0.0 mm
/gate/source/Src4/gps/ang/type      iso
/gate/source/Src4/gps/ang/mintheta    0.0 deg
/gate/source/Src4/gps/ang/maxtheta  180.0 deg
