/gate/source/addSource              Src8
/gate/source/Src8/gps/particle      gamma
/gate/source/Src8/gps/energy        159.0 keV
/gate/source/Src8/setActivity      640000 Bq
/gate/source/Src8/gps/pos/type      Volume
/gate/source/Src8/gps/pos/shape     Cylinder
